      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__Camellia_1ga1c3bd4137ced8eab896fbf8a07e2daaa" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>int</type>
        <definition>int wc_CamelliaCbcEncrypt</definition>
        <argsstring>(Camellia *cam, byte *out, const byte *in, word32 sz)</argsstring>
        <name>wc_CamelliaCbcEncrypt</name>
        <param>
          <type>Camellia *</type>
          <declname>cam</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>byte *</type>
          <declname>out</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const byte *</type>
          <declname>in</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>word32</type>
          <declname>sz</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>This function encrypts the plaintext from the buffer in and stores the output in the buffer out. It performs this encryption using Camellia with Cipher Block Chaining (CBC). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>この関数は、バッファーの平文を暗号化し、その出力をバッファOUTに格納します。暗号ブロックチェーン（CBC）を使用してCamelliaを使用してこの暗号化を実行します。</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>none No returns.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>cam</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>pointer to the camellia structure to use for encryption </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>out</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>pointer to the buffer in which to store the encrypted ciphertext </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>in</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>pointer to the buffer containing the plaintext to encrypt </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>sz</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the size of the message to encrypt</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<emphasis>Example</emphasis> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Camellia<sp/>cam;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>initialize<sp/>cam<sp/>structure<sp/>with<sp/>key<sp/>and<sp/>iv</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">byte<sp/>plain[]<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>//<sp/>initialize<sp/>with<sp/>encrypted<sp/>message<sp/>to<sp/>decrypt<sp/>};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">byte<sp/>cipher[sizeof(plain)];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">wc_CamelliaCbcEncrypt(&amp;cam,<sp/>cipher,<sp/>plain,<sp/>sizeof(plain));</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Camellia_1gaa14269edd231064aff504ac919d6934e" kindref="member">wc_CamelliaCbcDecrypt</ref></para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>none いいえ返します。 </para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>cam</parametername>
